OL,3,GNEWSARailways and 'dead zoo' free to
OL,4,Aenter this weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's the second and final weekend of
OL,7,Fthe annual festival, organised by Manx
OL,8,FNational Heritage and now in its 17th
OL,9,Fyear. All events are free, though most
OL,10,Fneed to be booked in advance.
OL,12,FConnie Lovel, chief executive of Manx
OL,13,FNational Heritage, said the programme
OL,14,F"opens doors, sparks curiosity and
OL,15,Finvites people of all ages to
OL,16,Fexperience the Isle of Man".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
